WEBVTT

00:00:00.167 --> 00:00:01.242
Seven tutorials.

00:00:01.242 --> 00:00:02.467
Every one made sense.

00:00:02.467 --> 00:00:03.729
Then they're gone, and it's just

00:00:03.729 --> 00:00:05.792
you and a blinking cursor.

00:00:06.921 --> 00:00:08.095
Watching is not building.

00:00:08.095 --> 00:00:10.095
Start small, but start alone.

00:00:10.909 --> 00:00:12.185
Guided projects in Placiq.
